OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FThe dedicated team at Barnsley A&E
OL,7,     Fneed to be ready for anything and
OL,8,     Feverything. 20 year old carpet
OL,9,     Ffitter accidentally stabbed
OL,10,     Fhimself in the leg at work and
OL,11,     Fneeds stitches.
OL,12,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,13,     FThere's major trauma when a hay
OL,14,     Fbale lands on a farmer's head in a
OL,15,     Fremote location. Plus, a battle to
OL,16,     Fsave a man in cardiac arrest, and
OL,17,     Fa 76-year-old woman has fallen
OL,18,     Fdown the stairs.
