OL,5,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FAn alcohol-dependent patient is
OL,7,     Ftransferred to resus after a fall,
OL,8,     Fjust in time to intercept a
OL,9,     Fseizure, and a man with a
OL,10,     Fdislocated shoulder has a shocking
OL,11,     Freaction to pain medication.
OL,12,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FInsight at a specialist clinic
OL,14,     Fwhere four top dermatologists
OL,15,     Ftreat a range of conditions.
OL,16,G0000 Street Cops: Catching the Yobs
OL,17,     FThe Street Cops are back, hunting
OL,18,     Fdown hooligans and tackling
OL,19,     Ftroublesome tearaways. Kettering
OL,20,     FPolice receive a tip off about an
OL,21,     Forganised county line crime gang.
