OL,5,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Natalia treats a 22 year-old
OL,7,     Fplumber with a cyst he's had since
OL,8,     Fadolescence, Dr Emma contends with
OL,9,     Fsome large crusty lesions and Dr
OL,10,     FAdil meets an audiologist covered
OL,11,     Fin lipomas.
OL,12,G0335 Car Pound Cops
OL,13,     FPolice investigate a series of
OL,14,     FPolish number plates, and find
OL,15,     Fthat a foreign vehicle is being
OL,16,     Fused in the UK without road tax.
OL,17,     FTraffic police request a vehicle
OL,18,     Fseizure from a car park. (Ep3)
